##* {{RQ:Shakespeare Othello Q1|act=IV|scene=ii|page=73|passage=The Moore's abus'd by ſome outragious knaue: / Some baſe notorious knaue, some '''ſcuruy''' fellovv, {{...}}}}
##* {{RQ:Shakespeare Tempest|act=III|scene=ii|page=12|column=1|passage=VVhat a py'd Ninnie's this? Thou '''ſcuruy''' patch: / I do beſeech thy Greatneſſe giue him blovves, {{...}}}}
